"""
ag-icons — inline-SVG icon registry for Django, replacing ad-hoc emoji.

  ICONS      : name -> inner SVG markup (Heroicons-style 24x24 outline paths).
  EMOJI_MAP  : emoji char -> icon name. The "emoji database": grep an old
               template for an emoji, look it up here, swap in {% icon %}.

Add "ag_icons" to INSTALLED_APPS, then in templates:

    {% load icons %}
    {% icon "sparkles" class="w-4 h-4 text-warning" %}

Or from Python: ag_icons.render_icon("sparkles", "w-4 h-4").

Icon artwork: Heroicons (https://heroicons.com), MIT (c) Tailwind Labs.
"""

